Rather than upping their AC, why not upgrade their HP recovery?

My mental image of a Barb (from the Governator I suppose), is a big
tough guy who takes hits and is hurt, but quickly shrugs it off.

So the changes I would make would be:

Reduce their spell casting chances.

50% bonus to HP recovery.

They can train STR all the way to 18/**.

Double speed recovery from afflictions (blindness, sleeping, etc, but
not hallucination.)

While under hallucination they get MR and a double STR damage bonus.

